<title>JAPAN: Shin Nippon Air - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shin Nippon Air - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 32.51		vs	   33.89</p>
<p> Operating	  627    million    vs	  457    million</p>
<p> Current	    961    million    vs	    1.16</p>
<p> Net		  387    million    vs	  397    million</p>
